:48.385" end="02:53.042">e</span></text><text for="L22"><span begin="03:55.924" end="03:57.612">kizutsuku</span><span begin="03:57.612" end="03:57.908">no</span><span begin="03:57.908" end="03:58.828">ga</span><span begin="03:58.828" end="04:00.037">sadame da</span><span begin="04:00.037" end="04:00.252">to</span><span begin="04:00.252" end="04:00.459">shi</span><span begin="04:00.459" end="04:00.667">te</span><span begin="04:00.667" end="04:00.915">mo</span><span begin="04:01.721" end="04:02.329">kokoro</span><span begin="04:02.329" end="04:03.521">wa</span><span begin="04:03.521" end="04:04.513">mada</span><span begin="04:04.513" end="04:04.969">iro</span><span begin="04:04.969" end="04:05.233">o</span><span begin="04:05.233" end="04:07.069">hanatsu</span></text><text for="L23"><span begin="04:07.471" end="04:08.931">sayonara</span><span begin="04:08.931" end="04:10.011">judas</span><span begin="04:10.371" end="04:11.091">hai</span><span begin="04:11.091" end="04:11.791">ni</span><span begin="04:11.791" end="04:12.921">nare</span><span begin="04:13.261" end="04:13.711">dust</span><span begin="04:13.711" end="04:14.031">to</span><span begin="04:14.031" end="04:14.341">dust</span><span begin="04:14.661" end="04:15.231">itsu</span><span begin="04:15.231" end="04:15.501">ka</span><span begin="04:15.501" end="04:16.121">no</span><span begin="04:16.121" end="04:16.741">yowa</span><span begin="04:16.741" end="04:16.971">sa</span><span begin="04:16.971" end="04:18.361">e</span></text><text for="L24"><span begin="04:19.231" end="04:19.651">kizu</span><span begin="04:19.651" end="04:21.391">darake</span><span begin="04:21.391" end="04:21.930">no</span><span begin="04:22.440" end="04:23.450">garasu</span><span begin="04:23.450" end="04:23.750">no</span><span begin="04:23.750" end="04:24.350">kokoro</span><span begin="04:24.350" end="04:24.740">ga</span><span begin="04:25.060" end="04:27.075">wasure ka</span><span begin="04:27.075" end="04:27.710">keta</span><span begin="04:28.020" end="04:28.530">netsu</span><span begin="04:28.530" end="04:28.810">o</span><span begin="04:28.810" end="04:30.710">tomosu</span></text><text for="L25"><span begin="04:31.030" end="04:31.760">saigo</span><span begin="04:31.760" end="04:32.370">no</span><span begin="04:32.370" end="04:33.460">stardust</span><span begin="04:33.980" end="04:36.520">maiagare</span><span begin="04:36.860" end="04:37.330">dust</span><span begin="04:37.330" end="04:37.630">to</span><span begin="04:37.630" end="04:37.960">dust,</span><span begin="04:38.320" end="04:38.770">ash</span><span begin="04:38.770" end="04:39.080">to</span><span begin="04:39.080" end="04:39.460">ash</span><span begin="04:39.730" end="04:40.620">kanata</span><span begin="04:40.620" end="04:42.080">e</span></text><text for="L26"><span begin="04:42.820" end="04:43.630">negai</span><span begin="04:43.630" end="04:44.143">no</span><span begin="04:44.143" end="04:45.152">hahen</span><span begin="04:45.152" end="04:45.848">yo</span><span begin="04:45.848" end="04:46.456">towa</span><span begin="04:46.456" end="04:47.168">e</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-CN"><text for="L1">狂风骤雨无休止飘落 任雨水打湿颤抖的肩</text><text for="L2">行至心中理想的尽头</text><text for="L3">擦破的稚嫩小手 拾起已然褪色的记忆</text><text for="L4">直至掩埋空缺的缝隙</text><text for="L5">眷恋 柔情 舍弃所有也无妨</text><text for="L6">只要找回丢失之物就好</text><text for="L7">哪怕命中注定遍体鳞伤 这颗心仍在绽放着光彩</text><text for="L8">最后的星尘飘扬高空 尘归尘 土归土 向着彼方</text><text for="L9">心愿的碎片啊 传递吧</text><text for="L10">骤雨渐行渐远 夜风消散而去</text><text for="L11">唯有孤独 仍驻足在旁</text><text for="L12">自身选择的正义 步步皆错也无妨</text><text for="L13">只要守住心中信念就好</text><text for="L14">伤痕累累的玻璃之心 点燃差点忘却的余温</text><text for="L15">最后的星尘飘扬高空 尘归尘 土归土 向着彼方</text><text for="L16">心愿的碎片啊 请去往永恒</text><text for="L17">勇敢之光</text><text for="L18">留在今夜</text><text for="L19">拯救我生命</text><text for="L20">那勇敢之光</text><text for="L21">勇敢之光</text><text for="L22">哪怕命中注定遍体鳞伤 这颗心仍在绽放着光彩</text><text for="L23">别了 Judas 化为灰烬 尘归尘 回归懦弱的曾经</text><text for="L24">伤痕累累的玻璃之心 点燃差点忘却的余温</text><text for="L25">最后的星尘飘扬高空 尘归尘 土归土 向着彼方</text><text for="L26">心愿的碎片啊 请去往永恒</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="04:47.168"><div begin="00:26.220" end="00:49.280" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="00:26.220" end="00:31.857" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:26.220" end="00:27.530">ふりしきる</span><span begin="00:27.530" end="00:28.330">強い</span><span begin="00:28.330" end="00:28.900">雨 </span><span begin="00:29.415" end="00:30.512">描いた</span><span begin="00:30.512" end="00:30.889">理想</span><span begin="00:30.889" end="00:31.305">の</span><span begin="00:31.305" end="00:31.857">果て</span></p><p begin="00:32.350" end="00:37.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:32.350" end="00:33.560">震える</span><span begin="00:33.560" end="00:33.940">肩</span><span begin="00:33.940" end="00:35.270">濡らし </span><span begin="00:35.270" end="00:36.230">歩き</span><span begin="00:36.230" end="00:37.500">続けた</span></p><p begin="00:37.970" end="00:43.850" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:37.970" end="00:39.430">擦り切れた</span><span begin="00:39.430" end="00:40.600">小さな</span><span begin="00:40.600" end="00:40.880">手 </span><span begin="00:41.140" end="00:41.990">隙間</span><span begin="00:41.990" end="00:42.320">を</span><span begin="00:42.320" end="00:43.030">埋める</span><span begin="00:43.030" end="00:43.850">まで</span></p><p begin="00:44.080" end="00:49.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:44.080" end="00:44.490">色</span><span begin="00:44.490" end="00:45.040">の</span><span begin="00:45.040" end="00:45.860">消えた</span><span begin="00:45.860" end="00:46.850">記憶 </span><span begin="00:47.080" end="00:47.960">拾い</span><span begin="00:47.960" end="00:48.400">集</span><span begin="00:48.400" end="00:49.280">めた</span></p></div><div begin="00:50.110" end="01:09.560" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="00:50.110" end="01:01.270" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5